WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.205
Start a new empty notebook. (3× speed)

00:00:00.205 --> 00:00:00.530
Upload the workshop book as the source. (3× speed)

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:01.598
The workshop book is being indexed. (3× speed)

00:00:01.598 --> 00:00:01.974
Focus on the complete request. (3× speed)

00:00:01.974 --> 00:00:04.555
Write the source-grounded request. (3× speed)

00:00:04.555 --> 00:00:06.661
Read the complete request.

00:00:06.661 --> 00:00:06.930
Send the question with the selected book. (3× speed)

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:07.517
Generate the answer from the selected source. (4× speed)

00:00:07.517 --> 00:00:07.714
Open the generated Audio Overview and inspect its player.

00:00:07.714 --> 00:00:10.595
Show the finished Audio Overview

00:00:10.595 --> 00:00:10.810
Inspect the original episode title, duration and controls.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.421
Open the original audio episode

00:00:12.421 --> 00:00:17.783
Watch a later 1× player excerpt, then pause.

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:23.600
Pause the episode

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:23.977
Resume the native player, then pause again.

00:00:23.977 --> 00:00:28.404
Resume the episode

00:00:28.404 --> 00:00:29.470
Pause the episode after resuming

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:31.654
Inspect the native playback speeds

00:00:31.654 --> 00:00:32.502
Keep the native player at normal speed.

00:00:32.502 --> 00:00:33.292
Keep normal playback speed

00:00:33.292 --> 00:00:33.392
Inspect the native export controls.

00:00:33.392 --> 00:00:34.633
Inspect the original audio export
